public/words.js
===============================================================================

The 2,048-word English wordlist from BIP39
https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0039/english.txt

Used for two things only: generating suggested passphrases when you press
"Generate", and recognising machine-generated phrases when scoring keyword
strength.

Coldvault never generates a recovery seed. You bring your own.

The same list is embedded in tools/kwcheck.php so that the offline keyword
auditor has no dependencies.

